{"sourceId":"thinksr","title":"ThinkSR: compact thought, dense output","lang":"en","scenes":[{"id":"s01-flow","intent":"The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, while the dense carrier stays in the image flow.","claim":"A persistent dense carrier, read and updated by a compact thought process.","narration":"The image first becomes a dense carrier, so spatial detail has somewhere to live. Windowing keeps the carrier dense while giving the thought process local tokens to read. The DQ-CTM stage is the recurrent part; each tick comes back to the thought process itself. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across ticks instead of adding a new block each time. The decoder reads the updated carrier back into the super-resolution image.","evidence":[{"kind":"section","id":"sec2"},{"kind":"figure","id":"fig-arch"}],"weight":0.9,"seconds":10,"objects":[{"id":"h","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.5,"y":0.11},"size":{"w":0.86,"h":0.09},"text":"ThinkSR loops inside the thought stage, not around the whole image flow.","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":68,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"g-enc","kind":"group","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.17,"y":0.47},"size":null,"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":null,"fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"box-enc","kind":"rect","parent":"g-enc","at":{"x":0.17,"y":0.47},"size":{"w":0.18,"h":0.16},"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":"a","fill":"surface","opacity":1},{"id":"lab-enc","kind":"text","parent":"g-enc","at":{"x":0.17,"y":0.47},"size":{"w":0.15,"h":0.08},"text":"Encode","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":52,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":1},{"id":"g-win","kind":"group","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.39,"y":0.47},"size":null,"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":null,"fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"box-win","kind":"rect","parent":"g-win","at":{"x":0.39,"y":0.47},"size":{"w":0.18,"h":0